    {
      "source": "A default <a href=\"../HandshakeHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\"><code>HandshakeHandler</code></a> implementation,\nextending <a href=\"AbstractHandshakeHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.support\"><code>AbstractHandshakeHandler</code></a> with Servlet-specific initialization support.\nAs of 7.0, this class prefers <a href=\"../jetty/JettyRequestUpgradeStrategy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.jetty\"><code>JettyRequestUpgradeStrategy</code></a> when Jetty WebSocket\nis available on the classpath, using <a href=\"../standard/StandardWebSocketUpgradeStrategy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.standard\"><code>StandardWebSocketUpgradeStrategy</code></a> otherwise.",
      "translation": "默认实现了一个<a href=\"../HandshakeHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\"><code>HandshakeHandler</code></a>，它扩展了<a href=\"AbstractHandshakeHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.support\"><code>AbstractHandshakeHandler</code></a>并提供了针对 Servlet 的特定初始化支持。从 7.0 版本开始，如果类路径上存在 Jetty WebSocket，该类将优先使用<a href=\"../jetty/JettyRequestUpgradeStrategy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.jetty\"><code>JettyRequestUpgradeStrategy</code></a>；否则，则使用<a href=\"../standard/StandardWebSocketUpgradeStrategy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.standard\"><code>StandardWebSocketUpgradeStrategy</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after population of normal bean properties but before an init\ncallback like InitializingBean's <code>afterPropertiesSet</code> or a\ncustom init-method. Invoked after ApplicationContextAware's\n<code>setApplicationContext</code>.",
      "translation": "在普通 Bean 属性填充之后、但在初始化回调（如 `InitializingBean` 的 `<code>afterPropertiesSet</code>` 或自定义的 init-method）之前调用。在 `ApplicationContextAware` 的 `<code>setApplicationContext</code>` 之后调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
